August 16 2026

Create React native app
npx create-expo-app@latest Quadrus --template blank-typescript --no-agents-md

Native wind installation
npm install nativewind

Install nativewind dependencies that is compatible with expo SDK installed
npx expo install react-native-reanimated react-native-worklets react-native-safe-area-context

Install native wind dependencies
npm install "tailwindcss@^3.4.17" "prettier-plugin-tailwindcss@^0.5.11" --save-dev

Initialize and create tailwind.config.css
npx tailwindcss init

Create and configure babel.config.js
npx expo customize > babel.config.js

Create and configure metro.config.js
npx expo customize > metro.config.js

Intalling missing dependencies in nativewind
npm i react-native-css-interop

Installing Expo router
npx expo install expo-router react-native-screens expo-linking expo-constants

Installing Jest
npx expo install jest-expo jest @types/jest "--" --save-dev

Error code ERESOLVE fix
npx expo install jest-expo jest @types/jest -- --save-dev -- --legacy-peer-deps

Installing react-native-testing-library
npx expo install @testing-library/react-native "--" --dev
npm install --save-dev test-renderer --legacy-peer-deps

